    "rich_text_RcKtix": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_D8mnLJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>V2 Hoodie & V2 Zipped Hoodie in Bone</strong></p><p>Our newest colourway for the Seventh staple: Bone is a classic muted tone defined for the season. Crafted from soft, premium fabric, it offers both comfort and versatility for everyday wear. Its relaxed fit and minimalistic design make it perfect for layering, while subtle details like refined stitching and a contemporary cut elevate its style. Whether you’re running errands or lounging, this hoodie provides the perfect balance of ease and modern flair. A must-have piece for those who appreciate laid-back sophistication with an edge.<br/><br/><br/><strong>Denim 410 in Vintage Tide Blue & Denim 440 in Indigo DenimI</strong></p><p>ntroducing Denim 410 to our range: a slightly lighter piece in breathable 100% Cotton in a lighter colourway. The Seventh Denim 440 Workwear Jeans are a merge of two worlds - taking inspiration from vintage workwear, we pay homage to the history of denim whilst combining it with a practical silhouette. Both pieces are designed to be functional, easy to incorporate pieces in your Spring/Summer outfit selections. Our Denim range has quickly become a Seventh family fave: we’ve responded with these additional designs and colourways to provide everyone with more options for everyday.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
