    "rich_text_rxT7Pj": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_XwXtR9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>M5 Cuban Shirt in Mushroom and Ecru</strong></p><p>The M5 Cuban shirt is a bold fusion of classic style and modern innovation. This unique piece features a distinct Cuban collar, offering a relaxed yet sharp silhouette that captures the effortless elegance of laid-back luxury. Made from 100% Cotton, it’s perfect for both warm weather and layering. The standout feature of the M5 Cuban shirt is its magnetic fastening system, which adds a touch of ease to the design of this timeless shirt style. Sleek, seamless closure at the front with magnetic clasps that provide both functionality and a clean, minimalistic look. Ideal for everything from comfortable workwear to formal Summer evenings.<br/><br/><br/><strong>Orb Shell Jacket in Graphite</strong></p><p>Designed to be the perfect multifunctional layer, The Orb Shell Jacket is our newest take on a transeasonal piece. With a sleek and minimal silhouette, its built for the ease of navigating the city whilst still maintaining stylistic edge. In ‘Graphite’, the Orb Shell Jacket is a versatile piece for dressing up or down. Made from 100% Nylon, featuring signature press buttons, an internal adjustable shock cord and elastic cuffs<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
