    "rich_text_TrDiAH": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_eMTtJb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Denim 440 Dome Cap</strong></p><p>The Denim 440 Dome Cap is the perfect all year round baseball cap. Made from our signature 440 Denim fabric in ‘Indigo’, our cap is complementary to our Bermuda range and Carpenter pants. With contrast yellow stitching, the Dome Cap is minimal with a subtle pop of colour. Featuring an adjustable backstrap, our Cove cap is roomy and comfortable making this the cap to grab and go.<br/><br/><br/><strong>Moon Sac in Mushroom</strong></p><p>The Seventh Moon Sac is the ultimate travel companion for the season, offering about twice the capacity of our original Lunar Sac. It features a smooth, wide strap that sits comfortably on the shoulder or across the body, reducing strain and enhancing comfort. The bag’s interior is lined with durable, waterproof nylon, ensuring easy cleaning and practicality. Crafted from 100% cotton and quilted for added texture, this bag is the perfect choice for all your travel adventures.<br/><br/><br/><strong>Lunar Sac in Graphite</strong></p><p>Our core accessory for your Seventh wardrobe: Comfort and practicality were the primary focus during the design of the Lunar Sac bag. Crafted from 100% nylon, the Lunar Sac is built for everyday use. Its adjustable sling strap comfortably fits the body while remaining highly functional. This is the go-to bag you can effortlessly grab for any errand or outing, no matter the destination.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_eMTtJb"
      ],
